      "title": "About the AI Venture Lab",
      "recipe": "Section \u2192 Text",
      "rendered_reference": "https://www.insead.edu/insead-centre-entrepreneurship",
      "content_html": "<div class=\"component-region-content text\"><div class=\"text-long\"><p>The INSEAD AI Venture Lab brings founders, researchers, investors and technology partners together to explore how AI changes the way businesses are built.</p><p>Through practical programmes and field research, the Lab helps entrepreneurs put AI to work in their ventures and develops evidence on AI-powered venture creation.</p></div></div>"
    },
