    {
      "id": "faq",
      "title": "Frequently asked questions",
      "recipe": "Section \u2192 Accordion \u2192 Text",
      "rendered_reference": "https://www.insead.edu/master-programmes/mba/academics",
      "content_html": "<dl class=\"accordion accordion--border_top component-region-content\"><dt class=\"accordion__title accordion__title--gap-small\"><button class=\"native-accordion-button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"answer-0\">Who can apply?</button></dt><dd class=\"accordion__content\" id=\"answer-0\"><div class=\"component-region-content text\"><div class=\"text-long\"><p>Early-stage founders from anywhere in the world can apply. You must be at least 18. You do not need an INSEAD affiliation or an AI product.</p></div></div></dd></dl><dl class=\"accordion accordion--border_top component-region-content\"><dt class=\"accordion__title accordion__title--gap-small\"><button class=\"native-accordion-button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"answer-1\">Is the Sprint free?</button></dt><dd class=\"accordion__content\" id=\"answer-1\"><div class=\"component-region-content text\"><div class=\"text-long\"><p>Yes. There are no participation fees and the Lab takes no equity.</p></div></div></dd></dl><dl class=\"accordion accordion--border_top component-region-content\"><dt class=\"accordion__title accordion__title--gap-small\"><button class=\"native-accordion-button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"answer-2\">How much time should I set aside?</button></dt><dd class=\"accordion__content\" id=\"answer-2\"><div class=\"component-region-content text\"><div class=\"text-long\"><p>Plan for around 2\u20133 hours each week during onboarding and the final weeks, and 4\u20135 hours each week during the build phase. The Sprint does not require full-time availability.</p></div></div></dd></dl><dl class=\"accordion accordion--border_top component-region-content\"><dt class=\"accordion__title accordion__title--gap-small\"><button class=\"native-accordion-button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"answer-3\">When do applications close?</button></dt><dd class=\"accordion__content\" id=\"answer-3\"><div class=\"component-region-content text\"><div class=\"text-long\"><p>Applications close on 1 December 2026 at 11:59 pm Singapore time (GMT+8). Selected founders are expected to be notified in early January 2027.</p></div></div></dd></dl><dl class=\"accordion accordion--border_top component-region-content\"><dt class=\"accordion__title accordion__title--gap-small\"><button class=\"native-accordion-button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"answer-4\">Can I take part as a mentor or Community Lead?</button></dt><dd class=\"accordion__content\" id=\"answer-4\"><div class=\"component-region-content text\"><div class=\"text-long\"><p>Yes. The Lab welcomes mentors and Community Leads. Use the involvement links below to learn more and apply.</p></div></div></dd></dl>"
    },
    {
      "id": "get-involved",
      "title": "Get involved",
      "recipe": "Section \u2192 External Listing Content \u00b7 text cards",
      "rendered_reference": "https://www.insead.edu/insead-centre-entrepreneurship",
      "content_html": "<div class=\"component-region-content external-listing-content\"><div class=\"grid grid--article-card\"><a class=\"grid__item grid__item--one-third link\" href=\"https://venture-lab.ai/apply/founder\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div class=\"card-object card-object--without-media external-listing-events\"><div class=\"list-object\"><h3 class=\"h3 list-object__heading\">Founders</h3><div class=\"list-object__description\">Use AI to build, test and grow your venture.</div><span class=\"link link--view-more\">Learn more</span></div></div></a><a class=\"grid__item grid__item--one-third link\" href=\"https://venture-lab.ai/apply/mentor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div class=\"card-object card-object--without-media external-listing-events\"><div class=\"list-object\"><h3 class=\"h3 list-object__heading\">Mentors</h3><div class=\"list-object__description\">Share your experience with the next cohort.</div><span class=\"link link--view-more\">Learn more</span></div></div></a><a class=\"grid__item grid__item--one-third link\" href=\"https://venture-lab.ai/apply/community-lead\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div class=\"card-object card-object--without-media external-listing-events\"><div class=\"list-object\"><h3 class=\"h3 list-object__heading\">Community Leads</h3><div class=\"list-object__description\">Connect founders and guide a peer group.</div><span class=\"link link--view-more\">Learn more</span></div></div></a></div></div>"
    },
    {
      "id": "programme",
      "title": "AI Founder Sprint 2027",
      "recipe": "Section \u2192 Text",
      "rendered_reference": "https://www.insead.edu/insead-centre-entrepreneurship",
      "content_html": "<div class=\"component-region-content text\"><div class=\"text-long\"><p>A virtual programme for early-stage founders to build, test and scale their ventures with AI.</p><ul><li><strong>Dates:</strong> 27 January\u20132 April 2027</li><li><strong>Duration:</strong> 10 weeks</li><li><strong>Format:</strong> fully virtual, in English</li><li><strong>Fees and equity:</strong> no fees, no equity taken</li><li><strong>Applications close:</strong> 1 December 2026 at 11:59 pm Singapore time</li></ul><p><a class=\"button button--primary\" href=\"https://venture-lab.ai/apply/founder\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Apply as a founder</a></p></div></div>"
    },
    {
      "id": "benefits",
      "title": "What selected founders receive",
      "recipe": "Section \u2192 Text",
      "rendered_reference": "https://www.insead.edu/insead-centre-entrepreneurship",
      "content_html": "<div class=\"component-region-content text\"><div class=\"text-long\"><ul><li><strong>Frameworks:</strong> Apply research on AI to real decisions in your venture.</li><li><strong>Practical learning:</strong> Use expert-led study groups to put tools into practice.</li><li><strong>Mentorship:</strong> Learn from experienced entrepreneurs, investors and AI experts.</li><li><strong>Global peers:</strong> Share progress and challenges with a curated founder group.</li><li><strong>Masterclasses:</strong> Get perspectives and feedback from founders and practitioners.</li><li><strong>Partner resources:</strong> Explore tools, credits and benefits offered by Sprint partners.</li></ul></div></div>"
    },
    {
      "id": "how-it-works",
      "title": "How the Sprint works",
      "recipe": "Section \u2192 Text",
      "rendered_reference": "https://www.insead.edu/insead-centre-entrepreneurship",
      "content_html": "<div class=\"component-region-content text\"><div class=\"text-long\"><h3>Weeks 1\u20132: Onboarding</h3><p>Meet your peer group and get familiar with the core frameworks. Plan for 2\u20133 hours/week.</p><h3>Weeks 3\u20138: Build</h3><p>Apply AI through study groups, masterclasses and mentor sessions. Plan for 4\u20135 hours/week.</p><h3>Week 9: VC Week</h3><p>Hear investor perspectives and explore what makes a company investable. Plan for 2\u20133 hours/week.</p><h3>Week 10: Test and refine</h3><p>Use mentor feedback to sharpen your work and prepare for Demo Day. Plan for 2\u20133 hours/week.</p></div></div>"
    },
    {
      "id": "eligibility",
      "title": "Who can apply",
      "recipe": "Section \u2192 Text",
      "rendered_reference": "https://www.insead.edu/insead-centre-entrepreneurship",
      "content_html": "<div class=\"component-region-content text\"><div class=\"text-long\"><p>Early-stage founders from anywhere in the world can apply. You must be at least 18. You do not need an INSEAD affiliation or an AI product.</p><p>The Lab looks for clarity of vision, motivation and a commitment to participate. Selected founders are expected to be notified in early January 2027.</p></div></div>"
