      "content_html": "<div class=\"image-text-variant-three external-listing-events component-region-content\"><div class=\"image-text-variant-three__left\"><picture class=\"image\"><img class=\"image\" src=\"sprint-2025.jpg\" alt=\"AI Founder Sprint 2025\" style=\"aspect-ratio:16/9;object-fit:cover;object-position:50% 20%\"></picture></div><div class=\"image-text-variant-three__right\"><h3 class=\"h3 h3--image-text-title\">AI Founder Sprint 2025</h3><div class=\"image-text-variant-three__description\"><p>August\u2013October 2025</p><p>The first Sprint brought together more than 500 founders across over 70 countries for a ten-week virtual programme.</p></div><div class=\"link-arrow\"><a class=\"with-arrow__link\" href=\"https://venture-lab.ai/past-programs/sprint-2025\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn more</a></div></div></div><div class=\"image-text-variant-three external-listing-events component-region-content\"><div class=\"image-text-variant-three__left\"><picture class=\"image\"><img class=\"image\" src=\"summer-camp-2026.png\" alt=\"Summer Camp 2026 programme visual\" style=\"aspect-ratio:16/9;object-fit:cover;object-position:50% 20%\"></picture></div><div class=\"image-text-variant-three__right\"><h3 class=\"h3 h3--image-text-title\">Summer Camp 2026</h3><div class=\"image-text-variant-three__description\"><p>June\u2013August 2026</p><p>A ten-week virtual experience with Audos, supporting aspiring founders in building their first business.</p></div><div class=\"link-arrow\"><a class=\"with-arrow__link\" href=\"https://venture-lab.ai/past-programs/summer-camp-2026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn more</a></div></div></div>"
