      "recipe": "Section \u2192 Text",
      "rendered_reference": "https://www.insead.edu/insead-centre-entrepreneurship",
      "content_html": "<div class=\"component-region-content text\"><div class=\"text-long\"><p>Bring your tools, expertise or network to a global community exploring AI-powered venture creation.</p><h3>Tools and technology</h3><p>Help founders experiment with platforms, product credits and technical resources.</p><h3>Expertise and mentorship</h3><p>Share practical experience through sessions and guidance for ventures.</p><h3>Networks and opportunities</h3><p>Connect the community to collaborators, investors and the wider entrepreneurial ecosystem.</p></div></div>"
